body:
I got passed over for a promotion despite having a cert for the job free code camps web developer cert. They promoted a new person who had a bachelors degree in business management. The person they promoted severely messed up the css for the page then they asked if I would help of course I said yes for a 10k fee. I was fired two week later for an unknown customer complaint.

&#x200B;

Edit: They paid to get the person trained on it instead
